      "content": "it just feels like there's no version of the future where this gets better. everything is just a cycle of trying to catch up and failing. it's like i'm just spinning my wheels until i eventually run out of gas. i look at the mess i've made and i honestly think the most logical thing would be to just... not exist anymore. to just have everything stop so the noise and the pressure finally go away. it almost seems like the only way to actually get some peace.",
